{"id":"a_","lemma":"à","pos":"prep","rank":11,"glosses":["to (destination)","at, in, on (said of a particular place)","at (said of a particular time)"],"ipa":"/a/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1a/Fr-%C3%A0.ogg/Fr-%C3%A0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Parlez-vous à votre chien ?","en":"Do you talk to your dog?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/70065","words":[{"g":"to speak, talk","l":"parler"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"dog"}]},{"text":"Je travaille à la poste.","en":"I work at the post office.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/334349","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to work","l":"travailler"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"job, post"}]},{"text":"On peut rentrer à la maison ?","en":"Can we go back home?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1097888","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to go back"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"house, home"}]},{"text":"Je reviens à dix heures.","en":"I'll be back at ten.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/25331","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come back","l":"revenir"},null,{"g":"ten"},{"g":"hour, time","l":"heure"}]},{"text":"Je crois à cette histoire.","en":"I believe that story.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2169","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe","l":"croire"},null,{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"story"}]}]}